【correct SQL】


====================

```sql
-- Fix: Handle division by zero and NULL values, filter for continuation schools, and select only needed columns
SELECT schools.`School`, 
       (frpm.`Free Meal Count (Ages 5-17)` * 1.0 / frpm.`Enrollment (Ages 5-17)`) AS free_rate
  FROM schools
  INNER JOIN frpm ON schools.`CDSCode` = frpm.`CDSCode`
  WHERE schools.`School` LIKE '%Continuation%'
    AND frpm.`Enrollment (Ages 5-17)` > 0
    AND frpm.`Free Meal Count (Ages 5-17)` IS NOT NULL
    AND frpm.`Enrollment (Ages 5-17)` IS NOT NULL
  ORDER BY free_rate ASC
  LIMIT 3;
```

