---

### **Answer:**

```sql
-- Corrected SQL
SELECT School, Website
FROM schools
WHERE "Free Meal Count (Ages 5-17)" BETWEEN 1900 AND 2000
  AND "Free Meal Count (Ages 5-17)" IS NOT NULL;
```

