### Corrected SQL:

```sql
-- Retrieve total free/reduced meal count for ages 5-17 in Youth Authority Schools with PO Box 1040 address
SELECT SUM(frpm.`Free Meal Count (Ages 5-17)`) AS total_free_reduced_meals
FROM frpm
JOIN schools ON frpm.CDSCode = schools.CDSCode
WHERE schools.MailStreet LIKE '%PO Box 1040%'
