SQL
```sql
SELECT T1.`gender`
  FROM client AS T1
  INNER JOIN district AS T2
  ON T1.`district_id` = T2.`district_id`
  ORDER BY T2.`A11` ASC, T1.`birth_date` DESC 
  LIMIT 1 
```

Final SQL
```sql
SELECT T1.`gender`
  FROM client AS T1
  INNER JOIN district AS T2
  ON T1.`district_id` = T2.`district_id`
  ORDER BY T2.`A11` ASC, T1.`birth_date` DESC 
  LIMIT 1 
```

