====================

Sub question 1: Identify all credit cards of type 'junior' that were issued after 1996-01-01.
SQL
```sql
SELECT c.`client_id`
  FROM card AS c
  INNER JOIN disp AS d
  ON c.`disp_id` = d.`disp_id`
  WHERE c.`type` = 'junior'
    AND c.`issued` >= '1997-01-01'
```

